.keep
UCODE SYNTACTIC DEFINITION
.sp
.nf L
.fs 4
<UCODE>		= <def>*
.sp
<def>		= (<state-name> (<state-name>*) (<state-exp>+) <effect>*)
<state-exp>	= (state <state-name>) | (select <io-name> <state-exp>+)
.sp
<effect>	= (<io-name> <exp>)
<exp>		= <number> | (pin <io-name>) | (select <io-name> <exp>+)
.sp
<io-name>	= <atom> | (<atom>+)
<state-name>	= <atom> | (<atom>+)
.fs
.fi B
.sp
Notes:
.ilist 4
"*" means "repeat the preceding non-terminal zero or more times".
.next
"+" means "repeat the preceding non-terminal one or more times".
.end_list
.end_keep
.keep
UMACHINE SYNTACTIC DEFINITION
.sp
.nf L
.fs 4
<UMACHINE>	= <this-environment-name><def>+
.sp
<def>		= (environment <environment-name>+) |
		  (interrupt <intdef>+) |
		  (new-int-level <number>) |
		  (enable <interrupt-name>) |
		  (disable <interrupt-name>) |
		  (default <full-binding>+) |
		  (case-map <map-name> <state-name>+) |
		  (label <state-name> <parameter-name>*) |
		  (<statement>+) |
		  (defmacro <macro-name> <macro-definition>) |
		  (<macro-name> <macro-arguments>)
.sp
<statement>	= (assert <binding>+) |
		  (goto <state-name>) |
		  (gosub <state-name> <value>*) |
		  (return) |
		  (escape <state-name>) |
		  (goto-case <map-name> <variable>) |
		  (if <predicate> then <statement>) |
		  (if <predicate> then <statement> else <statement>) |
		  (<macro-name> <macro-arguments>)
.sp
<intdef>	= <interrupt-name> <state-name>
<binding>	= <output-field-name> | <full-binding>
<full-binding>	= (<output-field-name> <value>)
<value>		= <number> |
		  <variable> |
		  (case-code <map-name> <state-name>)
<variable>	= (ref <parameter-name>) |
		  (input <input-field-name>)
<predicate>	= <status-line-name> |
		  (not <predicate>) |
		  (<predicate> or <predicate>) |
		  (<predicate> and <predicate>) |
		  (<predicate> xor <predicate>)
.fs
.fi B
.sp
Notes:
.ilist 4
"*" means "repeat the preceding non-terminal zero or more times".
.next
"+" means "repeat the preceding non-terminal one or more times".
